@startuml
title RNF10 — Notificações via Chrome (Web Push) · Diagrama de sequência
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber
actor "Head coach / manager (usuário autenticado)" as Manager
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
boundary "API" as API
control "UseCase" as UseCase
queue "EventBus" as EventBus
database "MySQL 8" as MySQL
database "Redis 7" as Redis
database "Cassandra 4.1" as Cassandra
participant "Agendador/Job assíncrono" as Scheduler
Manager -> Frontend: ativar notificações
Frontend -> Frontend: requestPermission · pushManager.subscribe(VAPID pública)
Frontend -> API: POST /me/push-subscriptions
API -> UseCase: RegisterPushSubscriptionUseCase.execute
alt assinatura inválida
  API --> Frontend: 422 PUSH_SUBSCRIPTION_INVALID (RFC 7807)
else senão
  UseCase -> MySQL: UPSERT push_subscription
  API --> Frontend: 201
end
Scheduler -> EventBus: JobOfferReceived / WeekCompleted / GoalCompleted
EventBus -> Cassandra: INSERT notification (TTL 90 d)
EventBus -> UseCase: NotificationDispatcher
UseCase -> MySQL: preferências e assinaturas
UseCase -> Redis: heartbeat e contador da hora
alt desabilitado ou usuário ativo
  UseCase -> Frontend: in-app (badge)
else senão
  UseCase -> UseCase: payload aes128gcm + assinatura VAPID (chave do Cofre)
  alt 404/410
    UseCase -> MySQL: DELETE push_subscription
  else senão
    UseCase -> Frontend: push entregue ao Service Worker
  end
end
Frontend -> Manager: showNotification · clique abre a tela
@enduml
